<%- include("partials/header", { title, page }) %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css">

<section class="page-hero map-hero">
  <div>
    <h1>FixOne配件库地图</h1>
    <p>查看FixOne配件库中心、附近已核验商家和本地生活服务点位。</p>
  </div>
  <a class="button outline" href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/search?query=%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%8E%BF%20%E9%AB%98%E6%A1%A5%E9%95%87" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">在 OpenStreetMap 打开</a>
</section>

<section class="map-layout">
  <div class="map-shell">
    <div id="fixone-parts-map" class="map-canvas" data-center='<%- JSON.stringify(mapCenter) %>' data-markers='<%- JSON.stringify(markers) %>'></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="map-panel">
    <h2>地图说明</h2>
    <p>地图底图使用 OpenStreetMap，页面保留版权署名。商家点位为 MVP 演示坐标，后续可以在商家资料里增加真实经纬度字段。</p>
    <div class="map-legend">
      <span><i class="legend-dot town"></i>镇中心</span>
      <span><i class="legend-dot shop"></i>商家</span>
      <span><i class="legend-dot landmark"></i>风貌点</span>
    </div>
    <h2>已接入点位</h2>
    <div class="map-marker-list">
      <% markers.forEach((marker) => { %>
        <article>
          <strong><%= marker.title %></strong>
          <p><%= marker.description %></p>
          <% if (marker.verified) { %><span class="verify">平台已核验</span><% } %>
          <% if (marker.href) { %><a href="<%= marker.href %>">查看详情</a><% } %>
        </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
<script src="/map.js"></script>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
